{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_145_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，晉侯使郤錡來乞師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"乞，重辭也。古之人重師，故以乞言之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"二、三月，公如京師。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"公如京師，不月，月非如也。非如而曰如，不叛京師也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，公自京師，遂會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、邾人、滕人伐秦。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"言受命，不敢叛周也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"四、曹伯廬卒於師。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"閔之也。公、大夫在師曰師，在會曰會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，公至自伐秦。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"六、冬，葬曹宣公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_145_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_145","textTraditional":"葬時，正也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}